sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant F as FastAPI
  participant O as OpenAI
  participant E as ElevenLabs
  U->>B: holds TRANSMIT and speaks
  B->>B: Web Speech API builds transcript and camera lerps to Earth
  U->>B: releases button
  B->>F: POST api chat with text, session id and character
  F->>F: append user turn to session history
  F->>O: gpt-4o-mini with colonist system prompt, max 120 tokens
  O-->>F: short in-character reply
  F->>E: text to speech with character voice, eleven_turbo_v2_5
  E-->>F: MP3 bytes
  F-->>B: audio body plus X-Zeph-Text and X-Session-Id headers
  B->>B: decode header text into chat log
  B->>B: squelch burst, bandpass and waveshaper playback, camera lerps to Mars
  B-->>U: colonist voice ends with second squelch, button re-enabled
